23. Regional Regulation Number 3 Year 2015 concerning Implementation of Protection of Women from Acts of Violence (Regional Gazette of West Kalimantan Province Year 2015 Number 3, Supplement to the Regional Gazette of West Kalimantan Province Number 3);

